  m_text: "You explore the museum by clicking the plaques beside \nthe exhibits.\n\n\nAt
    the end of the hall you meet children standing sadly\nin front of the straight-tusked
    elephant's plaque. To help them, click the drawing of the elephant and travel
    into \nthe past.\n\n\nIn the second scene, set in 1962, you dig up the elephant's
    bones. Once the skeleton is complete, return to the museum, the elephant stands
    whole and the children are happy."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b764d2234ba2d4856b64b76c920bd096, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5740928937063029901, guid: b764d2234ba2d4856b64b76c920bd096, type: 2}
